amarillo | yellow | Tengo un lápiz amarillo. | colors | 1 | I have a yellow pencil.
gris | gray; grey | Mi abuelo tiene el pelo gris. | colors | 1 | My grandfather has gray hair.
rosado | pink (also: rosa) | El flamenco es un pájaro rosado. | colors | 2 | The flamingo is a pink bird.
morado | purple | Mi color favorito es el morado. | colors | 2 | My favorite color is purple.

# The body
cuerpo | body | El cuerpo humano es increíble. | body | 2 | The human body is amazing.
cabeza | head | Llevo un sombrero en la cabeza. | body | 1 | I'm wearing a hat on my head.
cara | face | Me lavo la cara por la mañana. | body | 1 | I wash my face in the morning.
pelo | hair | Mi hermana tiene el pelo largo. | body | 1 | My sister has long hair.
ojo | eye | Tengo algo en el ojo. | body | 1 | I have something in my eye.
nariz | nose | El payaso tiene una nariz roja. | body | 1 | The clown has a red nose.
oreja | ear | Mi perro tiene una oreja negra. | body | 1 | My dog has one black ear.
boca | mouth | El dentista mira mi boca. | body | 1 | The dentist looks at my mouth.
diente | tooth | El bebé tiene un diente nuevo. | body | 2 | The baby has a new tooth.
mano | hand | Tengo un lápiz en la mano. | body | 1 | I have a pencil in my hand.

# Food and drink
comida | food; meal | La comida mexicana es deliciosa. | food | 1 | Mexican food is delicious.
bebida | drink | Una bebida fría, por favor. | food | 1 | A cold drink, please.
agua | water | Bebo mucha agua en verano. | food | 1 | I drink a lot of water in summer.
leche | milk | Bebo leche en el desayuno. | food | 1 | I drink milk at breakfast.
café | coffee | Tomo un café en la cafetería. | food | 1 | I have a coffee at the café.
refresco | soft drink; soda | Un refresco de naranja, por favor. | food | 1 | An orange soda, please.
vino | wine | Una copa de vino tinto, por favor. | food | 1 | A glass of red wine, please.
pan | bread | Compro pan todas las mañanas. | food | 1 | I buy bread every morning.
queso | cheese | Me gusta el pan con queso. | food | 2 | I like bread with cheese.
huevo | egg | Como un huevo en el desayuno. | food | 2 | I eat an egg for breakfast.
arroz | rice | Como arroz con pollo. | food | 2 | I eat rice with chicken.
pollo | chicken | Mi madre cocina pollo los domingos. | food | 1 | My mother cooks chicken on Sundays.
carne | meat | No como carne los viernes. | food | 2 | I don't eat meat on Fridays.
pescado | fish (food) | El pescado está muy fresco hoy. | food | 2 | The fish is really fresh today.
sopa | soup | La sopa está muy caliente. | food | 1 | The soup is very hot.
ensalada | salad | Quiero una ensalada verde. | food | 1 | I want a green salad.
sándwich | sandwich | Quiero un sándwich de queso. | food | 1 | I want a cheese sandwich.
papa | potato (in Spain: patata) | La papa viene de América. | food | 1 | The potato comes from the Americas.
tomate | tomato | La ensalada tiene tomate y queso. | food | 1 | The salad has tomato and cheese.
verdura | vegetables | Compro verdura en el mercado. | food | 2 | I buy vegetables at the market.
fruta | fruit | Como fruta todos los días. | food | 2 | I eat fruit every day.
manzana | apple | Como una manzana todos los días. | food | 1 | I eat an apple every day.
naranja | orange | Bebo jugo de naranja. | food | 1 | I drink orange juice.
plátano | banana; plantain | Hay un plátano en la mesa. | food | 1 | There's a banana on the table.
azúcar | sugar | ¿Tomas azúcar en el café? | food | 2 | Do you take sugar in your coffee?
sal | salt | La sopa necesita sal. | food | 2 | The soup needs salt.
postre | dessert | De postre quiero fruta. | food | 2 | For dessert I want fruit.
pastel | cake (in Spain also: tarta) | Hay un pastel para mi cumpleaños. | food | 1 | There's a cake for my birthday.
helado | ice cream | Me gusta el helado de chocolate. | food | 1 | I like chocolate ice cream.
galleta | cookie; biscuit; cracker | El niño come una galleta. | food | 1 | The boy is eating a cookie.
vaso | glass (for drinking) | Quiero un vaso de leche, por favor. | food | 1 | I'd like a glass of milk, please.
plato | plate; dish | El plato está en la mesa. | food | 1 | The plate is on the table.
cuchara | spoon | Necesito una cuchara para la sopa. | food | 2 | I need a spoon for the soup.
tenedor | fork | ¿Me trae un tenedor, por favor? | food | 2 | Could you bring me a fork, please?
desayuno | breakfast | El desayuno es a las siete. | food | 2 | Breakfast is at seven.
almuerzo | lunch | El almuerzo es a las dos. | food | 2 | Lunch is at two.
cena | dinner | La cena ya está lista. | food | 2 | Dinner is ready.
restaurante | restaurant | Conozco un buen restaurante aquí. | food | 2 | I know a good restaurant around here.

