pelota | ball | El perro juega con la pelota. | leisure | 1 | The dog is playing with the ball.
baloncesto | basketball (also: básquetbol) | Juego al baloncesto con mis amigos. | leisure | 1 | I play basketball with my friends.
tenis | tennis | Mi hermana juega al tenis los sábados. | leisure | 1 | My sister plays tennis on Saturdays.
piscina | swimming pool; pool (in Mexico: alberca) | Los niños nadan en la piscina. | leisure | 1 | The children swim in the pool.
guitarra | guitar | Mi padre toca la guitarra. | leisure | 1 | My father plays the guitar.
piano | piano | Hay un piano en la sala. | leisure | 1 | There's a piano in the living room.
canción | song | Esta canción es muy bonita. | leisure | 1 | This song is very beautiful.
cantar | to sing | Me gusta cantar en la ducha. | leisure | 1 | I like singing in the shower.
tocar | to play (an instrument); to touch | ¿Sabes tocar la guitarra? | leisure | 1 | Can you play the guitar?
dibujar | to draw | Me gusta dibujar animales. | leisure | 1 | I like drawing animals.
pintar | to paint | Quiero pintar mi habitación de azul. | leisure | 2 | I want to paint my room blue.

# Weather and seasons
tiempo | weather; time | ¿Qué tiempo hace hoy? | weather | 1 | What's the weather like today?
calor | heat; hot | En verano hace mucho calor. | weather | 1 | It's very hot in summer.
frío | cold | Hace frío y no tengo abrigo. | weather | 1 | It's cold and I don't have a coat.
sol | sun | Hoy hace mucho sol. | weather | 1 | It's very sunny today.
cielo | sky | El cielo está azul hoy. | weather | 1 | The sky is blue today.
nube | cloud | Hay una nube negra en el cielo. | weather | 1 | There's a black cloud in the sky.
lluvia | rain | Me gusta el sonido de la lluvia. | weather | 2 | I like the sound of the rain.
llover | to rain | Va a llover esta tarde. | weather | 1 | It's going to rain this afternoon.
nieve | snow | Los niños juegan en la nieve. | weather | 1 | The children play in the snow.
primavera | spring | En primavera hay muchas flores. | weather | 1 | There are lots of flowers in spring.
verano | summer | En verano vamos a la playa. | weather | 1 | In summer we go to the beach.
otoño | autumn; fall | En otoño hace fresco. | weather | 1 | It's cool in the fall.
invierno | winter | En invierno hay nieve en la montaña. | weather | 1 | In winter there's snow on the mountain.

